WEBVTT

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:09.190
Good morning, Cocona.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.780
Good morning.

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:17.280
What's the matter?

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.650
Did you have a bad dream?

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:23.290
Nah.

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:32.370
I'm off.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:35.620
Hey.

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:42.060
I got a final warning about my tardiness.

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:45.520
What's wrong? Muscle ache?

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:48.180
Did I sleep on it wrong?

00:00:52.430 --> 00:00:53.560
You're...

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:54.700
What the heck?

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:00.870
Yoohoo, Cocona!

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:03.980
Papika?!

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:36.880
Who're you?

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:38.240
Papika.

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:39.510
Who're you?

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:41.340
I see no need to introduce myself.

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:42.600
No fair!

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:44.660
You know her?

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:45.350
Nope.

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:47.310
Hey! Cocona!

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:48.430
What's the deal?

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:49.970
I've got school now.

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:50.810
I need to hurry.

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:52.350
Get on, then.

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:02.900
Here we are.

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:04.900
Look, you...

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:08.070
Are those wounds...

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:10.970
Are you okay?

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:12.870
They didn't do anything weird to you?

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:15.500
Stop it! I'm fine!

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:18.360
Thank goodness.

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:22.440
The fragment's safe, too.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.820
Is that it?

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:27.540
The thing that will grant wishes?

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:28.480
Yep.

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:30.850
Apparently, we've gotta 
gather a few more of them.

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:33.060
Let's go look for them again.

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:39.940
If you want to go, go by yourself.

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:41.810
I can't!

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:45.790
The tunnel only opens up if 
we both feel the same way.

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:48.990
I'm not powerful enough to go alone.

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:51.830
But I finally found a partner, and it's you!

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:55.940
I don't care.

00:03:56.720 --> 00:04:00.570
Didn't you have fun adventuring with me?

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:05.340
Let go of me!

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:12.230
You okay?

00:04:14.070 --> 00:04:15.100
Let me make this clear.

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:19.930
Outsiders aren't allowed on school premises.

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:21.440
They'll throw you out if they find you.

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:35.870
What was that all about?

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:37.660
Long story.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:44.340
Cocona?

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:47.850
Uexkull came with me!

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:49.090
Oh, big deal.

00:04:49.090 --> 00:04:50.400
It <i>is</i> a big deal!

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:52.410
What do I do?

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:03.280
Hollo!

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:04.650
Papika?!

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:07.910
Cocona!

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:12.260
Cocona, Cocona, Cocona!

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:15.210
Seriously, what's with you?

00:05:17.190 --> 00:05:18.800
What was it, again?

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:22.680
I'm a transfer student!

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:28.720
"...it passes the big ship and finally 
disappears again into the depths,

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:33.040
sputtering on the water as 
though the burning tongs

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:35.950
had been suddenly"—Quiet.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.190
You're awesome!

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:40.940
Cocona!

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:45.990
Want some rolled omelet?

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:48.630
Hey, why don't you join the basketball team?

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:56.410
Cocona!

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:58.000
Thanks.

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:09.470
Uexkull.

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:15.220
Uexkull?

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:16.780
Found you!

00:06:18.260 --> 00:06:20.410
Sniff, sniff, sniff, sniff.

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:21.860
Are you gonna eat here?

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:26.460
What are you playing at?

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:28.030
Where'd "transfer student" come from?

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:31.180
If I'm a transfer student, I can be with you.

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:32.030
Salt said so.

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:33.180
Who?

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:35.970
An important person in FlipFlap.

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:38.120
Did he order you to come here?

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:39.210
No.

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:41.830
I found you myself.

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:47.340
So, anyway, let's go 
adventuring after school—

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.220
I've got cram school then.

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:51.460
Wait.

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:53.790
I'm going to the bathroom. Don't follow me.

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:03.690
Me, too.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:13.070
Wait up!

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:14.370
Leave me alone!

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:17.740
Cocona.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:29.420
Cocona!

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:34.170
Is she gone?

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:36.100
Seems so.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:39.350
Thanks.

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:40.770
Wait.

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:44.040
Yayaka?

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:47.840
It's nothing.

00:07:50.890 --> 00:07:53.780
You gotta spell it out to people 
like her, or they'll never get it.

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:55.550
Yeah.

00:07:58.340 --> 00:07:59.460
You softie.

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:19.380
What do you think?

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:27.020
It's... scary.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:28.520
But...

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:32.400
But?

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:34.450
Nothing.

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:38.080
Come visit the art club sometime.

00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:41.980
I love this painting, too.

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:46.580
Cocona! I've been waiting!

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:53.890
Ow...

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.130
Uexkull!

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:02.710
Cocona!

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:16.930
Don't hold him by the ears.

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:23.620
He's terrified of you!

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:35.590
Sheesh.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.510
Before the teachers see him, I have to—

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:45.520
Uexkull! Uexkull!

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:48.940
Hey! Hey!

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:50.810
He's not coming out.

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.320
I've had it.

00:09:58.010 --> 00:10:00.280
It's always like this when I'm with you!

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:01.620
Why are you like this?!

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:04.490
You're wild, pushy, 
and have no sense of danger!

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:06.140
What if you die?!

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:08.330
It'd be too late for regrets!

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:11.420
Re...grets?

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:13.270
Even back then...

00:10:13.740 --> 00:10:15.490
I thought you'd die.

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:20.640
Go away, and don't come back.

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:23.140
I don't want to go on your stupid adventures.

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:24.600
Cocona...

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:27.890
I heard a cry.

00:10:29.880 --> 00:10:32.900
Uxe...kill? What was it, again?

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:34.330
Uexkull.

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:35.630
Uexkull!

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:41.320
Uexkull!

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:24.780
Papika?

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:26.500
Is that you, Papika?

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:30.400
Cocona!

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:38.300
Sniff, sniff, sniff...

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:33.940
Papika?

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:36.230
Is that you, Papika?

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:40.870
That...

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:42.720
That tickles!

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:45.760
Papika.

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:47.400
Your ears...

00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:49.240
You've got them, too.

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:54.480
No!

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:57.040
I've got all this fur all over!

00:11:57.040 --> 00:11:58.480
What do I do?!

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:09.060
Bite, bite, bite, bite...

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:09.060
Is that really safe to bite?

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:12.420
I don'd know, bud my jaw feelse 
weally westlezz for zome weazon.

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.800
You wadda bidey-bide, doo?

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:22.700
N-No way.

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:24.500
I'd never do anything so unseemly.

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:32.180
Uexkull?

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:33.440
He ended up here, too?

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:35.440
Where are you going?

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:37.420
To look for Uexkull.

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:39.440
What? But what about the fragments?

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:43.450
Weren't you listening to what I said earlier?

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:46.940
You stay right where you are.

00:12:46.940 --> 00:12:48.950
Or else you'll cause another disaster.

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:51.650
Cocona, wait!

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:54.660
Uexkull!

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.760
Uexkull!

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:03.400
Oh, honestly...

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.140
That looks hard...

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:11.040
Not again.

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:12.600
What's going on?

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:16.900
No. Absolutely not.

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:18.360
You mustn't go bitey-bite.

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:25.040
Cocona?

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.870
What's wrong, Cocona?

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:30.140
You okay?

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:31.840
No! Don't look!

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:33.800
Cocona... Cocona!

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:35.830
No!

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:00.560
Hup...

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:02.360
How much longer, Bu-chan?

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:07.780
Wow.

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:13.200
It's really hard.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.750
Got it!

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:34.100
What's happening?

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:48.900
Cocona!

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:56.750
Cocona! Cocona!

00:14:57.840 --> 00:14:58.880
Papika!

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:01.420
Cocona!

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:15.560
Are you...

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:17.930
Uexkull?

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.520
Cocona!

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:07.680
Cocona!

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:09.600
Cocona!

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:12.820
Blood

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:14.860
But Cocona's...

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:18.280
Papika!

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:20.600
Cocona's...

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:33.340
Cocona!

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:36.470
It's always like this when I'm with you!

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:38.290
Even back then...

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:39.680
I thought you'd die.

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:13.820
Cocona!

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:17.280
Papika?

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:19.820
Cocona! Thank goodness!

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:21.510
Papika...

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.730
What happened to you?

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:26.470
I kinda feel full of energy now.

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:28.010
Is this really a matter of energy?

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:29.610
Who's that?

00:17:31.370 --> 00:17:33.110
This is...

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:37.410
Run for it!

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:38.320
Where?

00:17:44.420 --> 00:17:45.920
Is that the way out?

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:48.280
I'm going.

00:17:48.280 --> 00:17:49.540
Papika?

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:51.540
Come with me.

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:54.640
I swear I won't let you go.

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:01.210
You'd better not, Papika.

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:02.180
Got it!

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:27.950
It didn't work!

00:18:27.950 --> 00:18:29.890
No, it stopped for a second!

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:31.880
I'll do the countdown!

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:34.380
Okay!

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:35.960
Three...

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:37.220
Two...

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:38.470
One...

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:41.390
Go!

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:55.440
Ow...

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:00.550
Uexkull.

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:01.860
I'm glad you're okay.

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:06.210
Cocona...

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:10.700
Now I get why you said you 
didn't want to go adventuring.

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:14.260
I thought you'd die, too.

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:16.850
Sorry.

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:20.080
But it was fun.

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:23.260
That last bit was awesome.

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:25.720
Will you go back again?

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:30.100
Yeah, I want to.

00:19:30.740 --> 00:19:32.040
You don't learn, huh?

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:35.980
Well, I don't mind going 
with you every now and then.

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:37.460
Okay...

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:38.740
Huh?

00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:41.400
Only every now and then. 
And if I feel like it.

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:47.740
Pain

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:44.850
Cocona! Cocona!

00:19:44.850 --> 00:19:47.740
Jeez, only every now and 
then, okay? You got that?

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:50.120
Cocona!

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:09.380
Where are we going?

00:20:09.710 --> 00:20:10.980
To FlipFlap.

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:12.850
I need to introduce you to everyone.

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:17.750
I'm back!

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:20.010
Welcome back.

00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:22.530
That must be the partner.

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:25.030
Nice to meet you. I'm Sayuri.

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:27.280
Nice to meet you.

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:29.100
Let's see...

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:33.920
Wh-What is it?

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:35.650
So you're Cocona.

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:38.670
Dr. Salt.

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:42.010
That's Salt.

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:50.820
Keep a fragment on you.

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:52.910
Take them to the Thomasson.

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:53.520
Got it.

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:56.040
Let's go.

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:57.410
Wait!

00:20:58.620 --> 00:21:04.360
We call the world you went to Pure Illusion.

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:09.320
Retrieving the fragments scattered there 
is your job for the foreseeable future.

00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:12.130
Both them are ready to go!

00:21:12.130 --> 00:21:13.010
<i>Roger.</i>

00:21:13.010 --> 00:21:14.370
<i>Let's get started, then.</i>

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:16.190
Job?

00:21:16.190 --> 00:21:18.000
Uh, working is against school rules—

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:20.920
No problem. There's no pay involved.

00:21:23.290 --> 00:21:24.500
Papika?

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:27.470
Cocona.

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:28.850
It's okay.

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:30.390
Papika.

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:34.200
<i>Dr. Salt, impedance is approaching zero.</i>

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:35.600
<i>Begin.</i>

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:36.310
<i>Um...</i>

00:21:36.630 --> 00:21:38.210
Salt-san.

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:41.070
What did you mean about the fragments?

00:21:41.390 --> 00:21:42.860
<i>Why are you collecting them?</i>

00:21:44.020 --> 00:21:47.070
To liberate Pure Illusion.

00:21:47.830 --> 00:21:49.580
Here we go, Cocona.

00:21:52.680 --> 00:21:53.970
What is this?

00:23:30.120 --> 00:23:32.260
Next time on <i>Flip Flappers</i>:

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:33.260
"Pure—

00:23:33.260 --> 00:23:34.640
Hey, Hidaka-san!

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:34.640
What?

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:36.390
Isn't last month's electricity 
bill way too high?

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:37.120
Uh, well...

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:39.390
Pure XLR

00:23:36.550 --> 00:23:38.130
How many times must you 
upgrade the equipment?!

00:23:37.800 --> 00:23:38.740
Retreat!

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:39.390
He ran away?!
